  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA doctor\u0027s syringe holds a cylindrical volume of fluid. The cylinder has a base radius of 1/4 inch and a length of 3 inches. Use your calculator to find out how much fluid is held in the syringe in cubic centimeters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the volume of the cylinder.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe volume of a cylinder is given by the formula\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"67\" height\u003d\"21\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_10_80/image018.gif\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eHere, \u003ci\u003er\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 1/4 and \u003ci\u003eh\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 3. So, we have\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg width\u003d\"101\" height\u003d\"49\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_10_80/image019.gif\" class\u003d\"text-top\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter this into your calculator. Press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20483\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20484\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qpi.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20484\u0026quot;,200)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20485\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qopenparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20485\u0026quot;,196)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20486\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20487\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdivide.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20487\u0026quot;,133)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20488\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20489\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qxsqr.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20489\u0026quot;,260)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20490\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtimes.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20490\u0026quot;,238)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20491\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20492\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20492\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the volume as about 0.589 in\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_10_80/f-80-10-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert to cubic centimeters.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert to cubic centimeters. Press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20493\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20494\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qconvert.gif\"\u003e and select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20495\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e for Volume. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20496\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e for in\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20497\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q6.gif\"\u003e for cm\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_10_80/f-80-10-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20498\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20498\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20499\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20499\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator gives the converted value as approximately 10 cubic centimeters.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_10_80/f-80-10-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
